--- only the hook may write gate.answered
    event-write.sh: gate.answered refused: gate.answered is written only by record-gate-answer.sh
    event-write.sh: gate.answered refused: accepted must say whether the answer is the accept option
--- junk input: exit 0
    [exit 0]
--- the shared reader: the newest answer counts
  spec-approval on 9f2c: the newest is the typed answer (no)
