--- the shape check runs inside the hold hook: a refusal keeps the card
  an ordinary gate: a question with no recommendation is refused for its shape
    Fix the question, then ask again: Tools: the first option must be the recommended one, its label ending with (Recommended). If there are no real options to recommend, take this question out of the dialog and ask it in a plain sentence
    card records left: 1
  the fixed question goes out with no new card
